;; gitcommit/COMMIT_EDITMSG — the faces its mode paints. Rewrite with (corpus/write-golden ["gitcommit"]) and review the diff.
1:0 "fix(indent):" keyword|symbol
1:12 " a closing brace backs out to its block" doc
7:0 "# Please enter the commit message for your changes. Lines starting" comment
8:0 "# with '#' will be ignored, and an empty message aborts the commit." comment
9:0 "#" comment
10:0 "# On branch main" comment
11:0 "# Changes to be committed:" comment
12:0 "#\tmodified:   src/indent.blsp" comment
